Terminals unused in grammar

    FLOAT_LITERAL


Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: recipe_declaration

    2 recipe_declaration: RECIPE IDENTIFIER LBRACE step_list RBRACE

    3 step_list: step_list step_declaration
    4          | step_declaration

    5 step_declaration: STEP INTEGER_LITERAL LBRACE action_list RBRACE

    6 action_list: action SEMICOLON
    7            | action_list action SEMICOLON

    8 action: GET IDENTIFIER
    9       | ADD IDENTIFIER INTEGER_LITERAL G_UNIT TO IDENTIFIER
   10       | ADD IDENTIFIER INTEGER_LITERAL L_UNIT TO IDENTIFIER
   11       | ADD IDENTIFIER INTEGER_LITERAL P_UNIT TO IDENTIFIER
   12       | ADD IDENTIFIER TO IDENTIFIER
   13       | COOK IDENTIFIER IN IDENTIFIER INTEGER_LITERAL MIN_UNIT
   14       | RETURN IDENTIFIER
   15       | BOIL IDENTIFIER IN IDENTIFIER INTEGER_LITERAL MIN_UNIT
   16       | DRAIN IDENTIFIER IDENTIFIER
   17       | MIX IDENTIFIER
   18       | SERVE IDENTIFIER


